      "description": "Career Center | UMass Dartmouth Skip to main content umassd.edu Directory Check My Status myUMassD UMassD Career Center Search UMass Dartmouth Menu Handshake Students Employers Faculty & Staff Alumni Events About Us Show carousel and video controls Carousel Slide: The Career Center offers career planning services to help you succeed. Slide: Handshake is your one stop to schedule appointments and search for jobs. Slide: Stop by our drop-in sessions for help with your resume and/or cover letter. Slide: The Career Center serves current students and alumni. Career Center The Career Center offers career planning services to help you develop a successful future. Learn more It's All in Your Handshake! Your one stop to schedule appointments, search for jobs and internships, and so much more! Did you know employers can find you on Handshake too? Complete your profile so potential employers can see all you have to offer! Log In We're Open Year-Round! Need help with starting a job/internship search? Wondering if your resume and/or cover letter needs some polishing? We're here fall, winter, spring, and summer - ready to help! Schedule appointment Congrats, Graduates! We're Still Here For you! The Career Center serves both current students and alumni. If you need us, we're here for you! Schedule an appointment on Handshake today! Find an advisor Schedule an appointment Students at the \"Dell Changing the Face of Technology\" event Students at the \"Dell Changing the Face of Technology\" event Students at the \"Dell Changing the Face of Technology\" event Students at the \"Dell Changing the Face of Technology\" event Students at the \"Dell Changing the Face of Technology\" event Previous Next Career Center Toggle navigation from this section Close In this section Handshake Students Your Career Advisor Community-based Work-Study Career Interests & Assessment Resources Resume & Cover Letter Job & Internship Search Internships at UMass Dartmouth Interviewing & Networking Graduate School Employers Post a job Attend a Career Fair Plan an Info Session Plan an On-Campus Hiring Event Recruiting Policies & Guidelines for Success Employer in Residence Career Center Advisory Board Career Conversations Faculty & Staff Alumni Events Mock Interview Day About Us Schedule an Appointment Meet the Staff In this section Handshake Students Employers Faculty & Staff Alumni Events About Us Toggle share controls Share on Facebook Share this on X Share on LinkedIn Print this page Email this page Copy URL Link copied to clipboard! University of Massachusetts Dartmouth HOME Career Center Career Center Career Center events Sep 8 Sep 8 12:30PM Resume-Palooza: Session 1 Kick off your fall semester by getting your resume in order! MacLean Campus Center Conference Room (2nd Floor) Sep 8 Sep 8 5:00PM Resume-Palooza: Session 2 Kick off your fall semester by getting your resume in order! MacLean Campus Center Conference Room (2nd Floor) Sep 9 Sep 9 12:00PM Resume-Palooza: Session 3 Kick off your fall semester by getting your resume in order! MacLean Campus Center Conference Room (Second Floor) Sep 9 Sep 9 4:00PM Resume-Palooza: Session 4 Kick off your fall semester by getting your resume in order! MacLean Campus Center Conference Room (2nd Floor) Sep 9 Sep 9 5:00PM Semester in the City - Pizza Party Info Session Enjoy some pizza and learn about the Semester in the City Internship Program. MacLean Campus Center Conference Room (2nd Floor) Sep 10 Sep 10 12:30PM Resume-Palooza: Session 5 Kick off your fall semester by getting your resume in order! MacLean Campus Center Conference Room (Second Floor) Sep 10 Sep 10 4:00PM The Washington Center - Pizza Party Info Session Enjoy some pizza and learn about The Washington Center internship program! MacLean Campus Center Conference Room (2nd Floor) Sep 10 Sep 10 5:00PM Resume-Palooza: Session 6 Kick off your fall semester by getting your resume in order! MacLean Campus Center Conference Room (2nd Floor) Sep 15 Sep 15 1:00PM Campus & Community Hiring Fair Find your opportunity! Met employers looking for part-time hires, interns, and volunteers. The Marketplace Sep 23 Sep 23 9:00AM Meet the Firms Ready, Corsairs? Come meet recruiters, learn about opportunities in accounting and finance. The Marketplace Oct 13 Oct 13 10:00AM Career Week: Handshake Launch Get Career Ready, Corsairs! Let's activate your Handshake account. Grand Reading Room, Claire Carney Library Oct 14 Oct 14 1:00PM Career Week: How to Work a Career Fair Get Career Ready, Corsairs! Prepare for next week's Business & STEM Career Fairs. Grand Reading Room, Claire T. Carney Library Oct 15 Oct 15 3:30PM Career Week: Create Your Elevator Pitch Get Career Ready, Corsairs! Build a quick self-introduction to use in your career journey. Grand Reading Room, Claire T. Carney Library Oct 16 Oct 16 10:00AM Career Week: Start Your Internship/Job Search Get Career Ready, Corsairs! Let's go find your opportunity. Grand Reading Room, Claire T. Carney Library Oct 21 Oct 21 1:00PM Business Career Fair Come find your opportunity or build your network, Corsairs! The Marketplace Oct 22 Oct 22 1:00PM STEM Career Fair Find your career opportunity or build your network in the STEM fields, Corsairs! The Marketplace Load More More Career Center events Launch UMassD events calendar Engage. Educate. Employ. Students We provide the resources you need to be successful in your career development and job search. Employers We help employers connect with our students: recruitment, internships, networking, and events. Faculty & Staff Faculty and staff are essential partners in helping Corsairs develop the workplace skills vital to career success. Alumni, Families & Friends Learn more about the Career Center and explore vital information about career development. Resources Get started with checklists, guides, and internship information. Handshake Our online platform lets you explore jobs, internships, and other career-related opportunities. I've been able to network with so many high-value employers at UMassD. This summer I'll intern at KPMG, who I met at a career fair on campus. Joey Capuzzo Senior, Accounting Aubrey Fazzone '26: Passion for cancer patient care Nursing student completes Flynn Oncology Fellowship at Yale Hospital and discovers calling for patient interactions and cancer care Mia Oliveira '26: Networking the coast Marine biology major conducts field research across the Cape and Islands while making industry connections at her SMAST internship Trina Xavier MS '25: Data and the blue economy Data science master's student discovers a sea of opportunities in the rapidly growing ocean-based workforce. Contact Career Center 508-999-8658 career.center@umassd.edu MacLean Campus Center , Suite 001 Office hours Meet the Staff Facebook Instagram TikTok LinkedIn/span> Back to top of page Visit us from anywhere, at any time. Take a virtual tour of the UMass Dartmouth campus. Visit us virtually University of Massachusetts Dartmouth 285 Old Westport Road, Dartmouth, MA 02747-2300 Extraordinary is what we do. ® Facebook X (Twitter) Instagram TikTok YouTube Linked in Directions Jobs at UMassD Annual Security Report Privacy Site Map Contact myUMassD Support UMassD Directory Apply Visit Request Info Check Application Status Accessibility Report an accessibility issue Dark Mode Off © 2026 University of Massachusetts Dartmouth + t 4 Close main menu Handshake myUMassD umassd.edu Staff Directory Search UMass Dartmouth Handshake Students Employers Faculty & Staff Alumni Events About Us News Events Campus Map Directions Handshake umassd.edu myUMassD Staff Directory"
